#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Protected chain/media adapter for the pre-reset automatic-restore supervisor.

The adapter deliberately has no V2 RPC/capture input.  It translates the
supervisor's earliest-failure-safe action contract to the already reviewed,
hash-pinned protected Alpha recovery helper.  Preflight runs every recovery
action in the helper's read-only dry-run mode; execute preserves the closed
pause -> archive -> restore -> smoke ordering enforced by the supervisor.

The default fixture backend is permanently NONDEPLOYABLE.  Protected access
requires the explicit ``PRIVATE_ALPHA_ROLLBACK_ONLY`` confirmation and the
existing deployment credentials loaded only by the pinned host helper.
"""

